summary: Configure Kdump to NFS target.
description: |
    The testcase it to configure Kdump to dump vmcore to a NFS server. It can be
    used in a multihost test to configure Kdump on client side, and setup NFS
    server on server side. Alternatively used in a single host test by specifying
    your NFS server via param 'NFS_SERVER'.

    There is another param called 'NFSOPT' which can be assigned per below:
    ---------------------------------
    Release  | Tell NFS in kdump.conf
    RHEL5    | net
    RHEL6    | net, nfs, nfs4
    RHEL7    | nfs
    ---------------------------------
contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: chmod a+x ./runtest.sh; ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
  - kexec-tools
  - nfs-utils
duration: 90m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/config-nfs
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/config-nfs
